  Flamingos
    From "Flamingo Fix", Steam Workshop 2913993465. The author credits Woodstock
    for working out the tile properties.
    Stated terms: open source, published on GitHub. The author's words are
    "Repackage, redistribute, recode, whatever, I don't care, do as you please.
    Credit would be appreciated." This is that credit.

    Bundled: no files. The tile definition shipped here is generated by
    tools/generate_flamingo_tiles.py out of build 42's own newtiledefinitions
