ASSETS GENERATED FOR THIS PROJECT

These are produced procedurally and share no pixels or bytes with any other mod:

  tools/generate_overlays.py       the moodle overlay textures
  tools/generate_ui_icons.py       the lock and drag mode icons
  tools/generate_book_icons.py     the skill book icons, recoloured from the
                                   base game's own sprites
  tools/generate_flamingo_tiles.py the flamingo tile definition, rebuilt from
                                   build 42's own tile data
  tools/pack_textures.py           lays the icons above onto one atlas and writes
                                   QoLCompendium.pack, which is what ships


